Diagnostics (M6A): --gpu_cp_stats logs every 10 s where the command processor thread spent its time:
executing packet batches, waiting for the game to write commands, and WAIT_REG_MEM waits (polls, sleeps,
the poll targets that waited longest); and in the Vulkan backend each presentation skipped because the
frame drew with an async placeholder pipeline. Off by default; no behaviour change.

